	"TagLine": "Oh no, Monsters! Who's going to protect us? The Defense Division has arrived!",
	"Description": "·•○♦ Get to know a little more about the Defense Division, Before Starting Your Journey! ♦○•·\n\nThe adventurers' guild aims to: \ninvade caves, hunt monsters and explore new areas. \nBut who protects the city and the townspeople, since there is no police?\n\nThis mod now includes the Defense Division!\nA subdivision of the guild, focused on protecting the region and people.\n\n____________________________________________________________________________\n\n·•○☼ Do you have any questions? See Our Instructions. ☼○•·\n\nSMAPI - Required\nContent Patcher - Required\nFarm Type Manager - Required\n\nFor Manual Installation:\n\n1° Download the Mod Requirements...\n2° Start by extracting the original mod and requirements into the folder:\nSteam\\steamapps\\common\\Stardew Valley\\Mods\n3° Ready! Just Play.\n\n____________________________________________________________________________\n\n·•○♣ Mod Made With A Lot of Effort, Blood and Sweat! ♠○•·\n\nProgramming and Map Designer: Kiyugamods\nArt and Support: Vlgor and Kiyugamods\n\n____________________________________________________________________________\n\n·•○♥ Thanks & Have a Happy Game. ♥○•·",
